# MCP writes and credentials

1. Prefer **Authenticate** on MCP `ecartpay-api` (Cursor OAuth 2.1 → production login on `https://ecartpay.com`). Partner Connect (`/connect-oauth`) is for apps that onboard merchants, not the Authenticate button.
2. Plugin Configure variables `ECARTPAY_MODE`, `ECARTPAY_PUBLIC_KEY`, `ECARTPAY_PRIVATE_KEY`, and optional `ECARTPAY_BASE_URL` are fallbacks when `ecartpay-api` is not authenticated.
3. Resolve the API host before any live call:
   - If `ECARTPAY_BASE_URL` is set, use it.
   - Else `ECARTPAY_MODE=production` → `https://ecartpay.com`
   - Else (default `sandbox`) → `https://sandbox.ecartpay.com`
4. On `ecartpay-api`, tools use Basic merchant keys from the OAuth session (same as stdio `createApiClient`). Send `x-ecartpay-mode`. Sandbox on that server requires linked sandbox keys — never send live keys to sandbox. On docs MCP `ecartpay`, create the JWT on **that same host** (`POST /api/authorizations/token`). Do not mix sandbox keys with the production host (or the reverse).
5. Dashboard login and OAuth app setup stay on production (`https://ecartpay.com`). API token + writes follow the selected mode host.
6. Before any MCP write to a non-sandbox Ecart Pay host, get explicit user confirmation.
7. Never put `client_secret`, `private_id`, or JWTs in committed code or casual logs.
8. Discover request shapes with MCP `ecartpay` `get-endpoint` / docs — do not invent fields. Authenticated live calls go through `ecartpay-api` scanned tools when available.
9. Live slash commands (`/setup-auth`, `/connect-oauth`, `/create-order`, `/create-payment-link`, `/create-checkout`, `/whatsapp-status`, `/send-whatsapp-payment`, `/get-order`, `/refund-order`) must use MCP `ecartpay-api` when Authenticate succeeded; otherwise docs MCP `ecartpay` `execute-request`. Skills cover docs and scaffolding.
10. `/connect-oauth` is Ecart Pay merchant Connect (Authorization Code → `public_id`/`private_id`). It is not Cursor MCP OAuth / the Authenticate button. Authenticate is `ecartpay-api` at `https://mcp.ecartpay.com/mcp`.
